 ears bride in a  way of a critical acclaim for his  performance in the comics inspired 2019  drama Joker  Joaquin Phoenix received the Toronto  International Film Festival tribute  actor award alongside Meryl Streep the  award recognizes decades of cinematic  excellence and during his acceptance  speech Joaquin made rare and emotional  comments about his late brother River  saying when I was 15 or 16 my brother  river came home from work and he had a  VHS copy of a movie called raging bolt  and he sat me down and made me watch it  and the next day he woke me up and he  made me watch it again and he said  you're going to start acting again this  is what you're going to do he didn't ask  me he told me and I'm indebted to him  for that because acting has given me  such an incredible life Phoenix also  credited his father John for gifting him  with an exceptional work ethic that  helped get him to this point but also  equipped that it might not have been  fully on display on the Joker set check  out one of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single  [Music]
 

